      "content": "\"close the book gently\"... that's exactly it. it's just so much more graceful than this constant, messy struggle. it feels like there's a certain dignity in just stepping away when the well is dry. like, why stay in a room when you know there's nothing left to see? it feels more like a release than a loss.",
